sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Mobile@{ "type": "boundary" } as Mobile app
    participant Browser@{ "type": "boundary" } as In-app browser
    participant API@{ "type": "control" } as Django auth views
    participant Keychain@{ "type": "database" } as Device keychain
    participant OIDC@{ "type": "boundary" } as OIDC provider
    participant Cache@{ "type": "database" } as Redis/cache
    participant DB@{ "type": "database" } as Django database

    User->>Mobile: Tap OIDC login
    Mobile->>Mobile: Generate code_verifier and state
    Mobile->>Mobile: code_challenge = BASE64URL(SHA-256(code_verifier))
    Mobile->>Keychain: Store verifier + state
    Mobile->>Browser: Open /authenticate/?<br/>response_type=code, code_challenge, S256, state
    Browser->>API: GET /authenticate/
    API->>API: Validate PKCE parameters
    API->>Cache: Store PKCE request data in Django session
    API-->>Browser: Redirect to OIDC authorization endpoint
    Browser->>OIDC: Authenticate user and grant access
    OIDC-->>Browser: Redirect to Django OIDC callback
    Browser->>API: GET callback
    API->>OIDC: Validate callback and resolve user
    OIDC-->>API: Authenticated user
    API->>Cache: Pop PKCE request data
    API->>Cache: Store one-time code -> user + code_challenge
    API-->>Browser: Redirect to /mobile-login
    Browser-->>Mobile: Deep link with code + state

    Mobile->>Keychain: Read verifier + expected state
    Mobile->>Mobile: Verify returned state matches expected state
    Mobile->>API: POST /api/v1.0/oauth/token/<br/>code + code_verifier
    API->>Cache: Get authorization code
    API->>Cache: Delete code immediately (single use)
    API->>API: Compute S256(code_verifier)<br/>and compare with stored challenge
    API->>DB: Confirm user exists and is active
    DB-->>API: Active user
    API-->>Mobile: access JWT + refresh JWT
    Mobile->>Keychain: Store access + refresh JWTs<br/>and clear verifier/state

    opt Access token later expires
        Mobile->>API: POST /api/v1.0/oauth/token/refresh/<br/>with refresh JWT
        API-->>Mobile: New access + refresh JWT
    end

    Note over API,Cache: An invalid verifier also consumes the code, so it cannot be retried.
